*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Le'Behemoth]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
