*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 210 seconds<sup>6,300f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] hard-counters this stage with its tankiness against [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] and immunity to freeze. Other than Cone, use the [[Ototo Corps|Thunderbolt Style]] to help your non-[[:Category:Cats with Freeze Immunity|freeze-immune]] units against Henry and some generalists like [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]].

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Stratospheric Pathway]] stages, Steps Great and Small references American culture. In this case, its name is a reference to "That's one small step for [a] man, one giant leap for mankind," a famous quote by American astronaut [[wikipedia:Neil Armstrong|Neil Armstrong]]. The reference is more apparent in its Japanese name, Ōinaru Chīsaki Ippo (大いなる小さき一歩, "One Great Little Step").

